// a route round enemy reach (danger_routes): Continental (seed 101, start_epoch 3), P2's base ~80,52. Two P3 towers at
// 70,50 and 70,54 (P2 sees them: its scout beside), then a P2 citizen and a P2 fishing boat... a citizen at 78,40 sent
// to 62,62 - the straight way passes the towers. With ship_route_log=1 the `# shiproute:` line gives its route's
// points; with danger_routes=1 they keep out of the towers' range + 2, `# danger:` the map's tiles. Two AIs.
wait_until(0.1min)
spawn(3, unit.b_guard_tower_bronze, 70, 50)
spawn(3, unit.b_guard_tower_bronze, 70, 54)
spawn(2, unit.inf02_spearman, 73, 52, 1)
wait_until(0.3min)
let c = player(2).spawn(unit.citizen, vec(78, 40), 1)
wait_until(0.45min)
cmd("move 2 78 40 3 62 62")
wait_until(0.9min)
cmd("uinfo 62 62 3")
